  "body": "A plethora of users using different updated clients are unaware of missing messages or receive messages out of order. Personally using element I've experienced repeating pages on Android while scrolling up. But the broader issue is synapse really needs a heartbeat error check feature or something so users are aware that messages are messed up. This has been an issue for years but now it seems worse than before. ",
